Response[0]:
<start_working_out>

To find the number of pencils lost, we need to subtract the number of pencils I have now from the number I bought.

Number of pencils bought = 16
Number of pencils now = 8

Pencils lost = Number of pencils bought - Number of pencils now
= 16 - 8
= 8

<end_working_out>
<SOLUTION>8</SOLUTION>
